# Curse of the Werefox: "Create a Monster Role token attached to target creature you control. When you do, that creature fights up to
# one target creature you don't control." Bot1 targets its Grizzly Bears (2/2). The Role makes it 3/3 with trample, the reflexive
# ability (CR 603.12) is put on the stack and Bot1 then chooses Bot2's Hill Giant (3/3) as the creature to fight (CR 701.14a). Each
# deals damage equal to its power: only the 3 the Role gives kills the Giant, and the Bears, 3/3, dies to its 3. The Role, an Aura
# token, goes with it (CR 704.5d). The cast names only the Bears: Bot2's creature is chosen as the reflexive ability goes on the stack.

